# fastlane generated output / artifacts
fastlane/README.md
fastlane/report.xml
fastlane/test_output/
fastlane/screenshots_ios_raw/
# fastlane/screenshots/ is intentionally NOT ignored — those are real App
# Store assets that CI and other developers need, not ephemeral output.
# fastlane/screenshots_ios_raw/ (above) is the raw per-campaign pool the
# `screenshots` lane generates for Custom Product Pages — regenerate with
# `bundle exec fastlane ios screenshots campaign:chat|code` rather than
# committing it; see docs/CUSTOM_PRODUCT_PAGES.md.

# Editor / network-mount temp files (e.g. .!12345!Foo.swift)
.!*!*

# Brand assets — large binary; extracted content lives in BRAND.md
